            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of an Enterococcus faecalis ATCC 19433 Siphovirus Isolated from Raw Domestic Sewage.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01179-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01179-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We previously isolated and characterized an Enterococcus faecalis ATCC 19433 siphovirus from raw domestic sewage as a viral indicator of human fecal pollution. Here, we report the draft genome sequence of this bacteriophage.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Santiago-Rodriguez et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
